OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start, with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain already across the region,
OL,7,Fsinking south during the morning.
OL,8,FDrier and brighter skies through the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with the odd shower
OL,10,Fpossible across the north. Feeling
OL,11,Fmuch fresher than in previous days.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continuing in the
OL,14,Fnorthwest within the northwesterly
OL,15,Fbreeze. These spread across the region
OL,16,Fto the southeast. Turning cloudier
OL,17,Fovernight, cooler than previous nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
